-tissue-silk-jangla-saree-1","ratio":"portrait","shot":"on_model_full","alt":"Full-length view of the draped piece: ivory saree in jangla weave with bel motifs","width":3000,"height":4500,"src":"/reference-only/products/chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree/01.webp"},{"id":"chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree-2","ratio":"portrait","shot":"on_model_drape","alt":"Three-quarter view showing the fall of the drape: ivory saree in jangla weave with bel motifs","width":3000,"height":4500,"src":"/reference-only/products/chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree/02.webp"},{"id":"chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree-3","ratio":"portrait","shot":"on_model_pallu","alt":"The pallu carried over the shoulder: ivory saree in jangla weave with bel motifs","width":3000,"height":4500,"src":"/reference-only/products/chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree/03.webp"},{"id":"chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree-4","ratio":"portrait","shot":"on_model_detail","alt":"Close view of the border against the body: ivory saree in jangla weave with bel motifs","width":3000,"height":4500,"src":"/reference-only/products/chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree/04.webp"},{"id":"chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree-5","ratio":"portrait","shot":"on_model_movement","alt":"The piece in movement, mid-turn: ivory saree in jangla weave with bel motifs","width":3000,"height":4500,"src":"/reference-only/products/chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree/05.webp"},{"id":"chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree-6","ratio":"square","shot":"detail_weave","alt":"Macro detail of the weave: ivory saree in jangla weave with bel motifs","width":3000,"height":3000,"src":"/reference-only/products/chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree/06.webp"},{"id":"chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree-7","ratio":"square","shot":"detail_border","alt":"Macro detail of the border and selvedge: ivory saree in jangla weave with bel motifs","width":3000,"height":3000,"src":"/reference-only/products/chandrika-ivory-tissue-silk-jangla-saree/07.webp"}],"narrative":"Tissue carries zari right through the weft, so the cloth is metallic before a single motif is placed on it. Over that, a jangla — a creeping vine with no resting ground, running edge to edge without a break. Two decisions that should compete and instead settle: the vine reads as shadow on a surface that is already light. Heaviest piece we have woven this year, and it does not feel it.","spec":{"colour":"Ivory and silver","technique":"Jangla, continuous vine across the full field","fabric":"Tissue silk with zari weft","speciality":"Silver zari throughout, with a kadiyal border in pale gold","collectionNote":"From Antaraal."},"provenance":{"workshop":"Sarai Mohana workshop","loom":"Pit loom, jacquard","weaveTimeWeeks":16,"artisanCount":3},"garmentType":"saree","weave":"jangla","fabric":"tissue-silk","colourFamily":"off-white","zariTypes":["real_zari","silver"],"motifs":["bel","jaal"],"campaign":"antaraal"}}],null]}],"$L23"]}]}],"$L24"]}]]}]
